%% Activity diagram: reviews and support tickets
flowchart TD
  A([Customer]) --> B{What to do?}
  B -- Review --> C[Open My Experiences]
  C --> D[Pick a checked-in or expired booking]
  D --> E[Choose 0 to 5 stars in half steps and comment]
  E --> F{Valid rating, comment up to 500?}
  F -- no --> G[Show error] --> E
  F -- yes --> H[Save or update review]
  H --> I([Event average updated on Explore])
  B -- Support --> J[Pick event, write subject and message]
  J --> K{Event known, subject 3+, message 10+, under 3 open?}
  K -- no --> L[Show error] --> J
  K -- yes --> M[Save ticket as Open]
  M --> N[Staff of that venue see it]
  N --> O([Staff marks it Resolved])
